---
#3959, track §12: every new form is experimental, so without `[unstable] allow`
the capability in a commons' `consumes`, the parameter and the binding are each refused.
---
context shop

consumes bynk { Logger }
consumes bynk.cloudflare { Kv, D1 }
uses lib.cache

capability Sessions = Kv
capability Archive = Kv
capability Orders = D1

fn save(key: String) -> Effect[String] given Sessions, Logger {
	remember(key, "v", given Store = Sessions)
}
